# Put the interfaces in their zones (this changes traffic at once):
#   zone WAN / interface wan
#   zone LAN / interface lan
#   zone DMZ / interface opt1
#   zone GUEST / interface opt2
#   zone FWS_VPNSITE / interface opt4
#   zone FWS_OpenVPN: no interface is known
# Written inactive:
#   Never to the blocklist (floating) 2: references 'Geo_block': an alias of type 'geoip' (the countries of a GeoIP database), whose addresses are not in the configuration
#   Guests never to the blocklist: not converted: it matches the source of traffic that leaves, which is the source after outbound NAT
#   Servers fetch updates: 'Updates' holds members only its platform knows
#   Servers fetch updates 3: 'Updates' holds members only its platform knows
#   Guests interactive (tos): not converted: it matches the type of service (tos) '0x10'
